%%body
{
  Entering the next chamber, the former one vanished once more, and you were starting to think you were in a simulation of sorts.

  Maybe you passed out from the actual training and were dreaming too, yeah you'd go with that idea.

    @ Voice "You greenhorns did well with the knives, let's see how you handle a gun!"

  You jolted upright, firearms were no laughing matter, but you did recall a catch.

    @ Voice "Who am I kidding, we're trusting you greenhorns with gunpowder, pick up a mana gun and shoot that dummy."

  Yep that was the catch, it was a WME Gun, only capable of firing small mana pellets at a target, you'd be lucky if it hurt anything except your feelings.

  Still you lifted the device and took a few shots at the target.

    @ Voice "You greenhorns aren't bad, I suppose we can trust you with a toaster at least."

  Ugh, screw that guy.
}
%date 2026-08-12
